# 日记三层模板的调用样例(IDEA 里直接点绿色箭头跑)

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 分页查询(role=1 的隐私日记在结果里不可见)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/page?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 关键字搜索
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/page?keyword=海

### 新增日记(role 不传默认 0=公开)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "今天试了三层模板",
  "content": "api→service→repositories,写起来有点 Spring 那味了。",
  "role": 0
}

### 查单条
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/1

### 修改:只改 role → 把 1 号公开日记收进小屋(0=公开 1=隐私)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": 1
}

### 再查一遍列表:1 号应该消失(未解锁时隐私不可见)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/page

### 改正文(可带 title/content/role 任意组合)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "补一句:浪比昨天大。",
  "title": "下午去海里泡了半天(补记)"
}

### 删除
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/2

### ===== 登录/会话(9/16 新增,IDEA 会自动管理 cookie) =====

### 问登录态(未登录也回 200,logged_in=false)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 登录(默认种子账号 admin/123456)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录后查资料(需上面的 cookie;password 不出后端)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/

### 改资料:PATCH 语义,只动传了的字段
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "yueyue@example.com"
}

### 解锁小屋(私钥默认 123456)→ 之后 /api/diary/page 能看到 role=1
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/private/unlock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "123456"
}

### 解锁后翻日记(未解锁时隐私条目不出现)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/diary/page

### 手动落锁
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/private/lock

### 改主密码(先验旧)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "123456",
  "new_password": "CHANGE_ME-9527"
}

### 改用户名(要验当前密码;改完记得改回来)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/username
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new_username": "kangzong",
  "password": "CHANGE_ME-9527"
}

### 登出(会话销毁,cookie 作废)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/logout

### ===== 相册(9/16 落地;上传/删除会真实读写 resources/photo/) =====

### 上传公开照片(先跑上面的 login 拿 cookie;文件路径相对项目根)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./smoke/sample.png
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

日常
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="role"

0
--WebAppBoundary--

### 上传隐私照片(role=1:未解锁小屋时列表/详情/出图全按不存在处理)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./smoke/sample.png
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="role"

1
--WebAppBoundary--

### 分页相册
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/photo/page?page=1&page_size=10
Accept: application/json

### 出图(浏览器打开同 URL 也能看图;id 换成上面返回的)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/photo/1/file

### 改分类/上锁下锁(部分字段,同 diary 的 PUT 语义)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/photo/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "出游",
  "role": 1
}

### 删除:库行和 resources/photo/ 里的文件一起消失(删除后去目录确认)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/photo/1

### ===== 资料库(规则同相册:落盘 resources/file/,挡可执行,下载带原名) =====

### 上传资料
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./smoke/sample.png
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="role"

0
--WebAppBoundary--

### 资料分页
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/file/page?page=1&page_size=10
Accept: application/json

### 下载(attachment,文件名用原始名)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/file/1/download

### 改展示名
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/file/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "改名后的资料.png"
}

### 删除:同样库行 + 磁盘双清
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/file/1
